WEBVTT

00:34:57.223 --> 00:35:00.908
So, imagine you have somebody
who's very extroverted who loves science,

00:35:00.932 --> 00:35:03.870
and that's what they really
want to do in some capacity.

00:35:03.894 --> 00:35:06.432
I speak to extroverts
sometimes who'll tell me,

00:35:06.456 --> 00:35:10.131
"Oh, my gosh. I work in this lab
and everybody's really introverted

00:35:10.155 --> 00:35:13.191
and it's deathly quiet
and nobody wants to talk,

00:35:13.215 --> 00:35:15.640
and I'm going crazy!"

00:35:15.664 --> 00:35:22.425
And so for that person, the answer is not
to leave the field of science, right?

00:35:22.449 --> 00:35:25.583
It might actually be -- and without
knowing more, we don't know --

00:35:25.607 --> 00:35:29.048
but it might actually be that they
would be better off in a different lab

00:35:29.072 --> 00:35:30.891
that has a slightly different culture.